WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.763
This example replaces the literal text KB with
keyboard Run

00:00:05.789 --> 00:00:11.359
the query and compare the raw description with the
expanded version This is

00:00:11.385 --> 00:00:17.312
appropriate because the transformation rule is
explicit and easy to audit In

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:22.733
larger projects repeated mapping rules may be better
stored in reference tables rather than hard-coded

00:00:22.759 --> 00:00:24.536
into one long SQL expression
